WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
BUILD 014. THE TOOL PRODUCED TEXT. Who researched, inferred, decided, approved?

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
LAYERS. RESEARCH. INTERPRETATION. INFERENCE. Each needs sources, authority, supervision, record.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
JUDGMENT. STRATEGY. ADVICE. APPROVAL. The responsible lawyer remains accountable.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
CLIENT. THE CLIENT STILL DECIDES. Tools cannot inherit client authority.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
SUPERVISION. REVIEW. CHANGE. STOP. RECORD. Labels are not controls.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
RESPONSIBILITY. TEXT DOES NOT MOVE IT. Applicable rules and counsel govern.
